# SkyPane — dev/CI dependency sources (direct pins only).
#
# Superset of the runtime lock: includes requirements.in so the compiled
# server/requirements-dev.txt is ONE file CI installs with
# --require-hashes, rather than two separately-compiled hash files that
# could disagree on transitive pins. deploy/deploy.sh never references
# this file or its compiled lock — production only ever installs
# server/requirements.txt.
#
# To regenerate server/requirements-dev.txt (and the runtime lock), run
# scripts/lock-deps.sh. Never hand-edit the hashes in the compiled lock.
-r requirements.in

